---
description: Route all UI work through design-mcp (native MCP or ds.mjs CLI). Encode Omni Composer = StationComposerHost and dumb-station showModeFaces law.
alwaysApply: true
---

When writing, modifying, or reviewing UI code, you MUST call `ds_contract`,
`ds_tokens`, and `ds_critique` before implementation.

- Prefer native MCP tools when `GetDynamicTools` lists `ds_*`.
- If the catalog is empty, run `node tools/design-mcp/ds.mjs …` (same server).
- Do not guess Tailwind classes, corner radii, or component paths.
- Hooks deny UI writes without a fresh `.cursor/design-mcp-session.json` stamp.

Naming: "Omni Composer" / station mouth = `StationComposerHost`, not raw
`OmnichannelComposerDock`. Dumb / gun stations keep `showModeRow` and set
`showModeFaces={false}` so the context ring stays bottom-right — never delete
the mode row to hide Unbox|Ticket. Floor stations clone Pack/Unbox; no invented
rails or second mouths unless explicitly asked.

Composer feedback / reaction / Zoho receive confirm on the mouth =
`WeldedFeedbackPanel` from `@/components/composer/WeldedFeedbackPanel` on
`StationComposerHost` `reaction` (`ds_contract "staff reaction on the composer"`).
Staff look at the mouth all day for what just happened and what to process next.
Never fork a caption band, second card, toast, or popover for that job.

Scan-station materials: `ds_tokens({ axis: "station-skin" })` (catalog =
`src/design-system/themes/station-skins.ts`). Call `applyStationSkin(name)`.
Do not hex-fill a well or fork a packing-bench class on one station.

DataTable / slot headers: every painted DATA track is click-to-sort
(`SLOT_TABLE_PAINT_LAW.headerSort`). Chrome only: select / actions / `_fill` /
`thumb` (Image photo gutter). Do not leave Status/Amount headers dead; freeze is not unsortable.
Do not pass `sort=` into `OrdersGridHost` — that disabled `?sort=` and made Shipped headers inert.
Orders / To-ship: no shared actions ⋮ (`ordersCompoundColumnsFor`). Copy is on the identity chips.
Selecting a row always opens the left Morphing menu on To-ship and Shipped; do not gate it on `queueMode === 'fulfillment'`.

Center Lock (Q5): desk record forms → `DeskStageOverlay` on the table stage
(`ds_contract "edit a row on the desk table"`). Forbidden on desks: `RightRailHost
detail:*`, new `DeskRecordWalkHost`, Dialog as record plane. Scan stations: Displays
stay right; L2 forms center; table stays visible under overlay. See
`docs/warehouse-os/PLAN-center-lock.md`.
